   3:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @file    stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c
   4:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @brief   FLASH HAL module driver.
   6:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          functionalities of the internal FLASH memory:
   8:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Program operations functions
   9:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Memory Control functions
  10:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Peripheral Errors functions
  11:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   *
