  13:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### FLASH peripheral features #####
  15:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  17:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses
  18:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations
  19:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  20:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  21:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
  22:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****        prefetch and cache lines.
  23:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  24:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The FLASH main features are:
  25:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  26:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
  27:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Read / write protections
  28:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Prefetch on I-Code
  29:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 64 cache lines of 128 bits on I-Code
  30:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) 8 cache lines of 128 bits on D-Code
  31:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash.c **** 
